        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "In the morning therefore ye shall be brought according to your tribes: and it shall be, that the tribe which the Lord taketh shall come according to the families thereof; and the family which the Lord shall take shall come by households; and the household which the Lord shall take shall come man by man.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 179,
            "end": 185,
            "text": "TG Family, Patriarchal."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 88,
