          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 7:15",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "So Joshua rose up early in the morning, and brought Israel by their tribes; and the tribe of Judah was taken:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 7:16",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "And he brought the family of Judah; and he took the family of the Zarhites: and he brought the family of the Zarhites man by man; and Zabdi was taken:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 7:17",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "And he brought his household man by man; and Achan, the son of Carmi, the son of Zabdi, the son of Zerah, of the tribe of Judah, was taken.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 18,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joshua 7:18",
        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "And Joshua said unto Achan, My son, give, I pray thee, glory to the Lord God of Israel, and make confession unto him; and tell me now what thou hast done; hide it not from me.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 55,
            "end": 60,
            "text": "1 Sam. 6:5."
